# These three are meaningful, shared operational scripts — the blanket
# *.ps1 ignore above is meant to skip local one-offs and node_modules' .ps1
# shims, not the repo's own automation. Keep them tracked.
!deploy-dashboard.ps1
!nightly-maintenance.ps1
!update-nas.ps1
!update-repo.ps1

